WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.530
The match is just getting started!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.470
I can't wait to see it...

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:08.940
The sight of you weeping, 
begging me to kill you.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.280
Sir?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.710
<b>Episode 10  "Diamondhand"</b>

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.750
A wooden sword...

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.540
There's a wooden layer inside the sheath?

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.460
I get it.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.380
He turned the sheath's inner layer into 
a sword that can cut through anything,

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.720
and slid the two blades against each other.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.260
Shrink.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.350
Oh, you noticed?

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.310
I've scattered them all around...

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.480
Lassos made from high-tech fiber.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:12.780
Shrink.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.530
The ability to shrink things...

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:23.120
I see. You've been shrinking distances.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:26.830
Yes, I move close by shrinking 
the distance between us.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:31.920
How many people did you kill 
to master that ability?!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.670
Guess you don't have much 
of an ability yourself.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.010
Maybe you don't get how it 
feels to have a strong one.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.970
Indeed, I can't understand you at all.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:47.470
How can you so freely use an 
ability those people gave you?

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:51.270
I used to be a bartender, 
uneducated and broke!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.320
But here, I'm a winner!

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.480
How can I not be enjoying this?

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.020
You're disgusting.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.780
This place is like heaven for me.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.610
I'm not about to let it end!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.920
Now I've got your neck in a guillotine.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.040
Feel like begging for your life?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.100
I have only one thing to say.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.100
I am going to make you pay!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.460
Are you, now?

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:20.710
Die.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:22.750
Stop it!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.720
Hareka!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.520
Sir!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.350
What were you thinking?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.100
You sniveling brat...

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.150
No!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.610
Die!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.400
Sir!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.200
<i>Shin.</i>

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.990
Heart Surgery
Special Ward

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.410
You're so cool, Brother!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.620
It's like you're invincible!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.910
Don't get too excited, now.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.750
Once you're all better, 
we'll be a team, partner!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.750
Yeah!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.180
Organ Donor Card

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.600
<b>In Surgery</b>

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:16.150
Brother... Brother...

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.570
Don't cry now.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.440
I'll always be with you.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.030
I promised, remember?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.570
We're a team.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:32.290
You didn't use your ability because you 
thought you'd disappoint me, right?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.290
But you've done enough.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.170
You have something to protect now.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.250
Let's do it, partner!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.260
Sir?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.090
Wh-What in the world...

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.700
I told you...

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.270
<b><<Diamondhand>> 

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:58.270
I was going to make you pay!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.400
Sh-Shrink!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.400
<i>Shin... You are invincible!</i>

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:22.170
I used my ability, but I still 
don't understand you at all.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.840
Sir!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.010
I'm so sorry! This is all my fault.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.800
You're so badly hurt...

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.720
Don't cry.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.720
I'll be fine.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.140
<i>I won't hesitate any longer.</i>

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:40.560
<i>I'm going to make them regret 
giving me these two seconds.</i>

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.070
Damn it!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:49.490
You don't feel any pain or fear, eh?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.450
How does a man get so stubborn?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.040
<i>You're mad, old man.</i>

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.500
<i>Before I came here,</i>

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.750
<i>I was human garbage,</i>

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.670
<i>only caring about my own survival,</i>

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.750
<i>making trouble for everyone around me.</i>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.010
<i>But since coming here...</i>

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.380
<i>I couldn't tell anyone this...</i>

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:13.890
<i>But meeting these people 
gave me a new lease on life.</i>

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.520
<i>Sorry, Asuka.</i>

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.480
<i>I don't think I'll be able to save ya.</i>

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:20.940
<i>But...</i>

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.660
<i>I'll hold him here for every second I can!</i>

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:29.990
Sir! Yuuri! Akira!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.450
I'm leaving the rest to ya!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.330
What nonsense is this, Katsuya?

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.120
Akira!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.920
What are ya doing here?

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.040
I knew where you were,

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.220
and this was the shortest 
route from there to Asuka.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.130
Glad I made it in time.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.590
What the...

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.850
Why didn't ya go right to Asuka?

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.730
Ya could've saved Asuka and killed Oogami.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.230
That's why I...

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.600
Why you tried to sacrifice yourself?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.320
Don't worry. Yuuri's there.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.180
But she'll have her hands 
full with fighting...

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.110
So I want you to save Asuka.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.210
Because it has to be you.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.160
I'll be moving to the 
next program after this,

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.370
but Team Green needs you.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.580
That's why

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.790
I will take over on this one.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.460
Got it.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.210
I'll save Asuka, I swear!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.100
Finished your little act?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.850
Act?

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.180
I suppose it was.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.350
But it was the only way to 
get Katsuya out of here.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.900
Since I made it in time,

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.730
I want to see it through.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.190
Eh? What's this now?

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.910
You were my target from the start!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.710
Is that a chemical reaction?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.630
An ability for creating spontaneous 
chemical reactions?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.050
That explains Katsuya's burns.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.170
I see.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:15.550
Kuro and Rindou were cautious of you.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.840
I now see why.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.720
But what about you?

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.520
You appear to use a cannon...

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.900
But your ability isn't really 
the cannon, I've heard.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:30.400
Kuroiwa's figured out your secret.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.810
You appear to have multiple abilities.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.770
But given that you threw a rock 
rather than use your cannon,

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.580
it suggests to me that you <i>can't</i> 
use the cannon now.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:44.330
I'm awfully curious what you think 
you can accomplish in your state.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:47.920
You're my toy to play with!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.550
Eh? Is he running away?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.180
No, is that...

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.160
That sword...

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.140
<b>It's not a cannon ability...</b>

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.100
He killed Rindou?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.560
<b>But then...</b>

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.350
He can use multiple abilities...

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.810
<b>He killed Rindou?!</b>

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.970
Does he copy abilities?!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.980
<b>What's he going to do with his sword?!</b>

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.560
Did he copy Rindou's ability?!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.020
Correct.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:18.240
<i>His formless blades ability is 
the only one I can't block!</i>

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.240
<i>You're takin' his sword?</i>

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.080
It's a regular wood sword if you 
don't got an ability like mine.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.330
Yes, but...

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.840
If you didn't know that,

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.280
you'd assume this was a real sword,

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.800
and that his ability was 
"invisible slashes," wouldn't you?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:39.140
<i>If the other person thinks that my 
ability is "invisible slashes,"</i>

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.790
<i>that's what it becomes.</i>

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.990
I'm taking your interface.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:52.020
What in the world... is your ability?

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.360
Oh, right...

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:57.740
You said you'd figured out that 
my ability wasn't the cannon...

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:02.030
But that's because I <i>let you know</i>.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.870
From the start of the third program,

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.330
I let everybody think 
I had the cannon ability.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.610
And right around the time that 
was becoming common knowledge,

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.840
I let a hint of the truth slip out.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.300
Akira Shiroyanagi's ability
is not the cannon

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.220
"He uses a cannon, but 
that's not his ability."

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:22.850
Ambiguity like that is a breeding 
ground for speculation.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.560
Who's in control of who here?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.020
You'll find out soon enough.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.730
<i>There's an assassin here 
who silenced the spy.</i>

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.940
<i>They must be here to kill our leader.</i>

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.610
<i>He was killed with a blade...</i>

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.490
<i>No, it can't be her.</i>

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.000
<i>She's been here since before 
the conflict with Red...</i>

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:52.000
<i>That's why I never checked her ability!</i>

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:54.880
What did you need to speak about?

00:10:57.470 --> 00:10:58.120
Momoko—

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.810
Yuuto... you knew?

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.590
I did.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.890
But I didn't want to believe it.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.230
Leader!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.310
Stay back!

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.230
She's dangerous.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.780
Momoko... What are you doing?

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:23.280
Your surprise attack failed. 
You know you can't beat me now.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.280
<b><<Mediator>>

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.330
Why in the world...

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.200
I really was on your side at the start.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:33.750
But then I learned that those 
boys were Team Red's leaders...

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.830
Hajime Oogami and Masaya 
Kuroiwa are my children.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.090
Children?!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.300
Surely you understand, 
as a father yourself.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:45.040
A parent would do anything 
for their children!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.890
Hold still, Momoko!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.850
Release your cannon and stand down!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.690
Hold still?

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.810
That's my line to you.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.190
Taro!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:00.030
Toss your interface aside 
and seal your own ability.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.470
Or I'll blow the child away.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.780
Have you gone mad?!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.910
If Red wins,

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.750
I'll take the child and raise him myself.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.660
I'll count to three.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.580
The boy or Team Green?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.210
Choose, Yuuto.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.460
Three.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.340
Leader...

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.880
Two.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:19.760
Don't do this!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.380
One.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.850
I just knew you would.

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:37.150
Farewell, Yuuto.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:40.900
I see.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.490
You've finished off old man Shirasagi, then?

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.320
It's all over now.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.700
Give up.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.960
No... Nothing's over at all.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.210
Isn't it?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.250
For the sake of everyone 
risking their lives...

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.160
Out of respect for our leader's devotion...

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.710
I can't let you have that child!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:06.340
<b>Mion</b>

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.340
<i>So very sorry! You haven't won yet!</i>

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:10.310
I was informed that we 
killed Shirasagi, though.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.520
<i>Oh, did you?</i>

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:15.640
<i>But you haven't taken Green's king.</i>

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:17.660
That's right.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.900
We were able to choose our own king.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.610
Are you the king, then?

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:34.000
I have a great number 
of things to ask you.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:38.790
Really, now...

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.840
You can't retrieve Taro 
if you keep hiding...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.590
<i>I'm afraid.</i>

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.260
<i>I really can't do this.</i>

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.390
You don't think you can do it?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.570
Even if I stay with our 
leader just in case...

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.730
My ability won't be useful at all.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.100
Have you ever really tried 
to copy an enemy's ability?

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.230
No...

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:04.090
I mean, at one-tenth values, 
it's basically pointless.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.070
I don't think it's pointless at all.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.110
Try it, and you'll see.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.740
Have faith in yourself.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.500
Just answer my question and I'll stop.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.210
Who's the king, if not Yuuto?

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.590
<i>If she doesn't hear it from me,</i>

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.760
<i>she'll go on to attack Akira and the others.</i>

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:33.930
<i>I'm supposed to stop the enemy 
in case something happens.</i>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:38.100
<i>That's the duty Akira left to me!</i>

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.690
I can't tell you that.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.440
Now give back Taro!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.570
Oh, really?

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.490
You force my hand, then.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.610
<i>It's coming.</i>

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.240
<i>I have to try it!</i>

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.450
<i>Help me, Akira!</i>

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.040
<i>This is...</i>

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.040
Try it, and you'll see.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:07.880
<i>The blast's power is reduced 
to one-tenth, but...</i>

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.430
<i>It also needs only one-tenth 
of the time to attack.</i>

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.310
<i>So I can fire at ten times the speed!</i>

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.730
Have faith in yourself.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.900
It's not a downgrade.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.570
It lets me create new abilities.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.940
That's how my ability works!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.280
I'd assumed it was an inferior copy...

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.110
But I see I was wrong.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.330
If you have the power to 
threaten those boys...

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.290
<b>Ringo Tatara
<<Plagiarist>></b>

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.290
<b>Momoko Sonomura
<<Guardian Angel>></b>

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.910
I must be rid of you!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.620
Momoko... Hide Taro somewhere safe.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.340
I don't think you want him 
getting hurt in our battle.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.330
How confident of you.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.260
Now... Let us begin.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.100
In a one-on-one capacity, they're equal.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:02.810
But...

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.440
<i>Please...</i>

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.440
<i>Hit just right...</i>

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.860
<i>Where is she?</i>

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.420
What's wrong?

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.090
Go on and shoot.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.340
I thought so.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.260
It seemed too obvious.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.140
Ringo dear...

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.060
You need a certain resolve 
in order to shoot someone.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.860
Now, tell me.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.690
Who is Green's king?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:50.990
Where are they?

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.020
I suppose this place is like hell to you.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:56.340
And yet...

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:59.540
There are others who came 
from hell to be here.

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:03.540
Those boys and I started in hell.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.960
I failed to save them.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.960
This time, I'll do whatever it takes 
to protect those in my care!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.970
I'll save Taro and start from square one.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.630
And this time...

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.090
Is that the only reason?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.220
Why you stole Taro from Asuka?

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.000
Why you killed that spy... and our leader?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.270
It's awful... It's too awful.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.560
I won't allow it...

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.740
And why in the world would 
I need your permission?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.450
I found my resolve.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.860
Resolve to do what?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:47.880
To do what it takes, 
instead of letting you have Taro.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.500
Don't you see?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.800
The place I just shot...

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.180
What's buried under that landslide...

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.180
It can't be...

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.350
You'd never do it.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:04.600
I'm sorry.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.740
No!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.400
Taro!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:14.940
I swore... I swore I'd 
protect you this time!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.780
He's gone?

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.990
That's not where he was.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.370
Taro was over here.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.120
I used my bullets to change the terrain,

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.170
so you didn't recognize it.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.340
I realized from the start.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.630
You'd only drop your guard 
if the child went missing.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.800
From the start?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.760
Then asking me to hide the child,

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.590
the reckless fire, and the 
explosion were all...

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.640
Drop your interface and seal your ability.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:47.010
This time, I really will shoot!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.020
Through your own actions, you've given me

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.690
the resolve to fire!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.870
I admit defeat.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:06.370
But Taro is mine!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.410
I knew it.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.210
This is who you really are.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.130
You don't want to protect this child.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:14.800
You just want to take him!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.120
For your own satisfaction!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.350
I just

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.180
couldn't protect them,

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.270
and I wanted to atone.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.230
This time... at last...

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.280
I see.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.320
But you aren't worthy enough to do that.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.410
So you were the king?

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.120
Akira Shiroyanagi...

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:52.790
Shouldn't you be more worried 
about your own king?

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.130
What's this now?

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.040
Just as you were focused on our leader,

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.130
I was also setting up this situation.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.220
What?

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.100
Havin' some trouble, huh?

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.190
Kirisaki!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.480
Found yourself a reinforcement, eh?

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.060
And not just one.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.520
Kumagiri!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:17.610
Yuuri, you've done an impressive job here.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.860
I have a message from Akira for you.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.160
He wants you to survive this, 
so he can apologize to you.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:29.160
Akira's got their strategist, 
Kuroiwa, locked down.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.080
No one's going to interfere.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.400
Which means

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:35.630
if we finish this guy off in the meantime,

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.590
the battle's over.

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:48.310
<b>Requests
 to 
Mion</b>

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:48.310
<b>Shout

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.130
The towers, eh?

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.050
10 MP from a tower plus 15 MP...

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:47.680
And you used that to locate me?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.310
Yes.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.810
We had one person in a tower.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.690
You really got me.

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.440
I had considered it, of course,

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:58.270
but I really didn't think you had the 
guts to not make Shirasagi your king.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.830
Having made yourself king despite the risks,

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:04.730
you must have confidence that 
you'll survive, and an ability to match.

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:08.440
But this plays into my hands.

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:12.010
Hold Kuro down while you gang up on me.

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.840
Is that what you're after?

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:17.940
Too bad.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:22.780
I think you've underestimated 
the both of us.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.550
My ability will finish you off.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.510
So it doesn't really matter what yours is.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.980
<b>Masaya Kuroiwa
<<Loanshark>></b>

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.980
<b>Akira Shiroyanagi
<<Sophist>></b>

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:39.980
<b><<Diamondhand>>

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:13.160
<b>Mion and Yang's
\h\h\hNext Episode Preview!</b>

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:13.380
Mion and Yang's Next Episode Preview!

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:15.320
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:16.790
Moe, moe!

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:18.190
Dakyuun!

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:19.960
Yeah! Yeah, yeah!

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.880
<i>Miss Mion said if I gave her 
one preview all to herself,</i>

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.050
<i>she'd take the remaining ones seriously.</i>

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:26.330
<i>Of course, I have my doubts...</i>

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:29.690
<i>I guess I've given her permission 
to give a musical performance.</i>

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:33.340
<i>For the sake of next week's preview, 
I hope that all of you</i>

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:36.150
<i>will understand and show some support.</i>

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.850
Everyone feelin' good?

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.260
Yeah!
